{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 580529, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 115387, "uid": 90022, "type": 15, "title": "光RB对抗策略", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1673184645, "updated_at": 1673329382, "updated_uid": 90022, "comment_at": 1673582161, "last_at": 1674044256, "comment_count": 17, "status": 1, "summary": "又到了喜闻乐见的光rd策划放飞自我时间，写在前面，本人认为这期rb起码得有一个烟枪人偶和稍微正常点的宝石才能考虑去挑战多打几层，如果你符合要求往下继续阅读，不符合建议不要继续投入资源。本期光RB这bo", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/424645.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/104814.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/461838.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 10, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 13443, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "加拿大", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 8, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 580529, "content": "<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">又到了喜闻乐见的光rd策划放飞自我时间，写在前面，本人认为这期rb起码得有一个烟枪人偶和稍微正常点的宝石才能考虑去挑战多打几层，如果你符合要求往下继续阅读，不符合建议不要继续投入资源。</span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">本期光RB这boss其实n和s的频率在20层往前非常低而且伤害甚至说可以忽略不记，主要是持续伤害在扣你血，所以处理好boss的ds技能就基本上可以很舒服的打完前20层（为啥说20层，后面10层我也是炸过去的，哈哈没精神跟rb耗着。）这阵容啥的也只是提供为参考你有更好打法以你为准。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">通关截图：</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><img data-width=\"667\" data-height=\"1140\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/424645.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/424645.png\" style=\"width:400px;height:682px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">摆烂历程：</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><img data-width=\"667\" data-height=\"1140\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/104814.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/104814.png\" style=\"width:400px;height:682px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">前面20层就20层乱了一次ds给用了两张票（刷条快再连点啥的会乱ds顺序）</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"667\" data-height=\"1140\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/461838.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/461838.png\" style=\"width:400px;height:683px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">开始摆烂直接boss开大我等死开始爆裂炸（有一说一真爽有票就是自信，最后还剩了几张）</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">阵容以及配置思路：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><img data-width=\"667\" data-height=\"1140\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/787791.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/787791.png\" style=\"width:400px;height:683px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">用双刃驱散boss给的负面效果，犹大开个n可以给乳贴和鸡尾酒拉条，ds我一号位给的是棒球（我烟枪是给到了棒球，有很高的一个恢复效果）如下图，悬壶济世了。我是有两个烟枪海油个给到了鸡尾酒给一个后续的恢复（看自己条件来吧，只有一个优先给棒球），剩下人偶是给了一个马斯人偶给包租婆加上包租婆队长效果吃点弱点伤害加成毕竟没带上伊芙（这个人偶可有可无，有的话就是提升点每把伤害）我大概满buff是一个170w一跳的ft</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><img data-width=\"479\" data-height=\"209\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_479/h_209/1069/90022/2023/0/8/45338.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_479/h_209/1069/90022/2023/0/8/45338.png\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">人偶：</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><img data-width=\"497\" data-height=\"193\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_497/h_193/1069/90022/2023/0/8/688614.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_497/h_193/1069/90022/2023/0/8/688614.png\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">（这个起码有一个）</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">&nbsp;<img data-width=\"498\" data-height=\"295\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_498/h_295/1069/90022/2023/0/8/830584.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_498/h_295/1069/90022/2023/0/8/830584.png\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">（有没有都行）</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">附魔要求和魂卡配置：</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">这期主要是以debuff给的伤害所以堆点抗性去打肯定没有坏处（有就装上没有也没必要硬洗附魔）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">附魔是饰品二号位s普通附魔给抗性那个。魂卡刀携带暗攻卡，剩下三个暗辅助带上规避卡（不要带交战，交战这期效果非常一般）萨拉苏带命中卡（如果感觉扛不住也携带规避卡）。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">魂卡：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"507\" data-height=\"336\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_507/h_336/1069/90022/2023/0/8/445074.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_507/h_336/1069/90022/2023/0/8/445074.png\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">（暗攻卡，刀带上）</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"525\" data-height=\"249\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_525/h_249/1069/90022/2023/0/8/372525.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_525/h_249/1069/90022/2023/0/8/372525.png\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"501\" data-height=\"288\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_501/h_288/1069/90022/2023/0/8/544054.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_501/h_288/1069/90022/2023/0/8/544054.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"515\" data-height=\"334\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_515/h_334/1069/90022/2023/0/10/371711.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_515/h_334/1069/90022/2023/0/10/371711.png\"></div><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">（规避卡，最好辅助人手一个，实在没有就用交战或者草莓，不认识交战和草莓自己去wiki查一下都有的）</div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"494\" data-height=\"266\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_494/h_266/1069/90022/2023/0/8/806886.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_494/h_266/1069/90022/2023/0/8/806886.png\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">（命中卡，这次萨拉苏挂破防相较于上次还挺容易的。扛不住就用下面那两张）</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"517\" data-height=\"255\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_517/h_255/1069/90022/2023/0/8/143876.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_517/h_255/1069/90022/2023/0/8/143876.png\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"501\" data-height=\"288\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_501/h_288/1069/90022/2023/0/8/522829.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_501/h_288/1069/90022/2023/0/8/522829.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"515\" data-height=\"334\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_515/h_334/1069/90022/2023/0/10/967798.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_515/h_334/1069/90022/2023/0/10/967798.png\"></div><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">实战操作需要注意的是最好就是你把ft卡在boss ds附近，乳贴有个小恢复而且打完基本上棒球无缝衔接ds回血（<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">队伍buff带辅助-1s冷却可以达到这种效果</span>）。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">本人阵容具体参数：</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"667\" data-height=\"1140\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/568607.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/568607.png\" style=\"width:400px;height:683px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"667\" data-height=\"1140\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/571292.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/571292.png\" style=\"width:400px;height:683px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"667\" data-height=\"1140\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/549635.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/549635.png\" style=\"width:400px;height:683px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"667\" data-height=\"1140\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/840017.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/840017.png\" style=\"width:400px;height:683px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"667\" data-height=\"1140\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/730498.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023/0/8/730498.png\" style=\"width:400px;height:683px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">（除了萨拉苏是饰品二号位命中附魔其他辅助均为规避附魔）</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">本期箱子就一个双红攻，微小的提升，练习八个月的新号已经完成五色rb30层。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"638\" data-height=\"204\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_638/h_204/1069/90022/2023/0/8/999583.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_638/h_204/1069/90022/2023/0/8/999583.png\" style=\"width:400px;height:127px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">祝大家都能出好点火石。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">本思路仅供参考如果你感觉不对以你为准，有问题可以来wiki群问，基本上都会在的，那么下期rd再见。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_1140/1069/90022/2023